OL,3,GNEWSAScotland needs to embrace AI for
OL,4,Aits potential to be realised, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland needs to embrace AI technology
OL,8,Fand trust the country's planning system
OL,9,Fto allow its potential to be realised,
OL,10,FInnovation Minister Alyn Smith has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe Scottish government said AI could
OL,14,Fgenerate an additional #23bn in annual
OL,15,FGDP for Scotland by 2035 with the right
OL,16,Finvestment and leadership, according to
OL,17,Findependent research.
OL,19,FIt comes at a time of widespread debate
OL,20,Fabout the technology's value, as well
OL,21,Fas opposition to a number of proposed
OL,22,FAI data centres in Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
