OL,3,GNEWSAScotland needs to embrace AI for
OL,4,Aits potential to be realised, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FSmith told the BBC: "People are up for
OL,8,Fthese developments but we need to see
OL,9,Fthe planning system augmented to take
OL,10,Fdue note of the significant
OL,11,Fimplications of some of these projects,
OL,12,Fparticularly on energy use."
